# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in the values. Every release build passes
# it with --dart-define-from-file=.env.
#
# SENTRY_DSN: Sentry -> Project settings -> Client Keys (DSN). Missing or
# empty means crash reporting stays off. Debug builds never report either way.
#
#   flutter build apk --release --dart-define-from-file=.env
SENTRY_DSN=
